This program uses, and statically links, the Verovio music notation engraving library,
version 6.2.1 (https://www.verovio.org), licensed under the GNU LGPL version 3 or later,
together with the libraries Verovio bundles (listed in THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md).

Corresponding source
- Verovio 6.2.1: https://github.com/rism-digital/verovio/tree/version-6.2.1, and the exact copy
  built into this program in the verovio-sys 0.3.6 crate: https://crates.io/crates/verovio-sys/0.3.6
- ferraus-engrave: https://github.com/djynnius/ferraus/tree/main/crates/ferraus-engrave (each
  release is tagged, e.g. https://github.com/djynnius/ferraus/tree/v0.1.5)
To use a modified Verovio, build ferraus-engrave from that source with your copy of verovio-sys
(for example through a [patch] section in Cargo.toml); `cargo build -p ferraus-engrave` relinks it.

